# Once Upon a Time: the free cast is an option ("you may cast it without paying"), not a requirement: as Bot1's first spell
# it is cast for its mana cost, {1}{G} from a Forest and a Mox Emerald (the "without" way is the other option; see the
# other scenarios). "You may reveal a creature or land card" is optional too: of the top five, an Ornithopter and an
# Island qualify, and Bot1 takes neither; all five go to the bottom, leaving the hand with six cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Once Upon a Time
Forest
Mox Emerald
Island x4
Ornithopter
Island
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Once Upon a Time.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Ornithopter; Island; Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Library.Count = 15
Bot1.Graveyard = Once Upon a Time
